# TLS session key logs (SSLKEYLOGFILE format) - can appear from OpenSSL-based tooling
# (e.g. the S7CommPlusDriver submodule under third_party/) run for local testing. Never commit:
# these let anyone with the file decrypt the matching TLS session's traffic.
key_*.log